  "sourceTitle": "Traditional Horseradish Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Traditional Horseradish Sauce\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 tablespoons Grated horseradish\n1 teaspoon Caster sugar\n1 teaspoon Salt\n1/2 teaspoon Pepper\n2 teaspoons Mustard. English\n4 tablespoons Single cream\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all in a bowl and serve.\n\nAbout\n\n\n Difficult it aint:) More horseradish means a hotter sauce. A little malt vinegar can be added though this is not recommended for anything other than commercial presentations where costs will outweigh appearance.",
